!/experiments/ra2-recomp-20261020/pcrecomp/tools/
!/experiments/ra2-recomp-20261020/pcrecomp/tools/**
!/experiments/ra2-recomp-20261020/pcrecomp/templates/
!/experiments/ra2-recomp-20261020/pcrecomp/templates/**

